# p5 usage: /usage after two billed turns (billed-turns.json: cacheRead 4000
# and 30000, reasoning 900), the footer's context and session segments on,
# the keys (no Esc until the end: on v0.0.16's message-only screen Esc
# closes it), /cost, /usage with an argument, /stats and /credits. Old fx counts
# the turns locally; v0.0.16 asks the Gateway's /v1/report (the fake answers
# 404). `home` keeps what each binary persisted; `gwlog` what was asked.
models models.json
gateway billed-turns.json
wait 2.5
type /statusline context
key Enter
wait 1
type /statusline session
key Enter
wait 1
snap launch
type first question
key Enter
wait 5
type second question
key Enter
wait 5
snap turns
type /usage
wait 0.7
snap typed
key Enter
wait 3
snap open
key Down
wait 0.5
snap down
key Enter
wait 0.7
snap enter
key Tab
wait 1
snap tab
key BTab
wait 1
snap btab
key Right
wait 1
snap right
key Left
wait 1
snap left
key r
wait 2
snap r
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap esc
type /cost
wait 0.7
snap cost-typed
key Enter
wait 2
snap cost
type /usage 7d
key Enter
wait 2
snap arg
key Escape
wait 0.3
type /stats
key Enter
wait 1
snap stats
type /credits
key Enter
wait 2
snap credits
home end
gwlog
